  "name": "Buffalo Chicken with Blue Cheese Slaw",
  "subtitle": "Roasted chicken with tangy hot sauce and crisp cabbage slaw",
  "description": "Tender chicken thighs are coated in a buttery hot sauce and served with a creamy blue cheese slaw featuring apple and celery.",
